      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I traced this to the following file:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/resources/dbspec/server/org/fcrepo/server/storage/resources/DefaultDOManager.dbspec#L147\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/resources/dbspec/server/org/fcrepo/server/storage/resources/DefaultDOManager.dbspec#L147</a><br/>\nit seems this is not compatible with Oracle since there is no boolean datatype</p>\n\n<p>And the commit from Oct. 2013:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/97b79b9f1379d8c34c4225e02adde7aa25d46f10\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/97b79b9f1379d8c34c4225e02adde7aa25d46f10</a></p>",
     "created": "14/Mar/14 2:27 PM",
     "id": "12587",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11177/comment/12587",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a48a5426330072ea6384",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
