  "description": "<p>As reported by Arnaud Koster from ARHS:<br/>\n-----------------------------------------------------<br/>\nBTW: It seems that Fedora 3.7.1 is not compatible with Oracle database. In fact, we faced a problem during the startup:<br/>\nFedora tries to execute this script:<br/>\nCREATE TABLE fcrepoRebuildStatus (<br/>\n    rebuildDate NUMBER(20,0) NOT NULL,<br/>\n    complete boolean NOT NULL,<br/>\n    UNIQUE  (rebuildDate)<br/>\n);</p>",
